## **1. Neglecting Proper Planning and Budgeting**

One of the most common mistakes in [bathroom renovations](/bathroom-renovations) is starting without a clear plan or budget. Without careful planning, homeowners often overspend or encounter delays when changes are made mid-project.

**Key Issues**

- Underestimating costs for materials, labour, and unexpected problems.
- Choosing fixtures and tiles before planning layout leads to sizing and compatibility issues.
- Overlooking building regulations and local codes in Brisbane/QLD.

**How Gold Star Bathrooms Avoids This**

- We provide detailed budgeting tips for [bathroom remodelling QLD](/remodel-bathroom-brisbane), ensuring clients know exact costs upfront.
- Our team plans layouts and fixture choices before any work begins, preventing costly changes mid-project.
- All projects comply with Australian standards, guaranteeing safety and durability.

**Example:** A client initially chose a luxury shower system without checking water pressure requirements. Gold Star Bathrooms adjusted the plumbing plan beforehand, preventing installation issues and extra costs.

